      "CAROL: No, I don't want to.\nJEAN: How about if we were to go up with you?\nCAROL: Will you sing with me?\nJEAN: I can't until you teach me the words. Come on.",
      "JEAN: Now we've got to have Carol sing the other one. This is the second song Carol wrote all by herself, you can do,\nBARBARA: She just doesn't fit, that kid."
